			"notes": "### 更新內容\n\n- 新增：第一次進遊戲的畫面。同意隱私權政策之前，連線功能（更新、同步翻譯、徽章、披風、網站登入）都不會開啟；之後可選推薦設定、自訂（照 F6 分類，每項附說明）或保留目前的設定。\n- 新增：F6「功能 → 隱私與連線」的「刪除我的資料」，會刪除伺服器上的報到紀錄、上傳的披風與網站帳號綁定，並停止上傳；「恢復上傳」可以再打開。\n- 新增：F6 物品頁可在翻譯過的技能名稱與 Major ID 名稱後面附上原文，說明文字裡提到的技能名也會附上。\n- 新增：WynnMarketSearch 打一個中文字就能搜尋譯名。\n- 變更：簡體中文不再拿繁體中文墊底；沒翻的名稱顯示英文，除非輔助語言選了繁體中文。\n- 變更：推薦設定的物品翻譯為關閉；新設定檔的另開面板間距預設為 4 px。\n- 變更：F6 的說明框改開在該列旁邊，不再蓋住下面幾列；F6 與第一次進遊戲的畫面加上簡短的過場動畫。\n- 修正：按 SHIFT 跳過時，譯文整句直接顯示。\n- 修正：記分板上的隊伍成員名字不再被翻譯。\n- 修正：精英怪被打之後，頭上的名字不再變回英文。\n- 修正：Wynnventory 顯示價格框時，另開的面板不再對不齊。\n- 修正：帶特效顏色的對話（例如 Off the Rails 的綠字）不再讓整句譯文變成那個顏色。\n- 譯文：七種語言補上 A Journey Beyond；日文新增多項內容（感謝 yool141 與 rink914）；簡體中文的名稱類清空，交給簡中團隊翻譯；繁中的 Mythic Warp 改譯為「躍遷」。\n\n### What's new\n\n- Added: a first-run screen. Online features (updates, translation sync, badges, capes, website login) stay off until you agree to the privacy policy, then pick Recommended, Customise (grouped like F6, with each option explained) or Keep your current settings.\n- Added: F6 Features → Privacy and connection: \"Delete my data\" removes your check-ins, uploaded capes and website link from the server and stops uploading; \"Resume uploading\" turns it back on.\n- Added: F6 Items option to show the original after translated ability and Major ID names, including names mentioned inside descriptions.\n- Added: WynnMarketSearch finds translated names from a single Chinese character.\n- Changed: Simplified Chinese no longer falls back to Traditional Chinese; untranslated names show in English unless Traditional Chinese is chosen as the auxiliary language.\n- Changed: item translation is off in the Recommended setup; the side panel gap defaults to 4 px for new configs.\n- Changed: F6 descriptions open beside the row instead of covering the rows below; F6 and the first-run screen have short transitions.\n- Fixed: pressing SHIFT to skip shows the whole translated line at once.\n- Fixed: party member names on the scoreboard are no longer translated.\n- Fixed: an elite mob's name no longer turns back to English after it is hit.\n- Fixed: the side panel stays aligned when Wynnventory shows a price box.\n- Fixed: dialogue with an effect colour (such as the green in Off the Rails) no longer turns the whole translated line that colour.\n- Translations: A Journey Beyond in all seven languages; Japanese contributions (thanks yool141 and rink914); Simplified Chinese names cleared for its own team to translate; Traditional Chinese Mythic Warp is now 躍遷."
		},
