			"notes": "### 更新內容\n\n- 修正：另開的譯文面板不再壓到原文，第一行也跟原文對齊；太高、被 Wynntils 縮放或被 Wynnventory 推開的物品說明也一樣。\n- 譯文：簡中任務對話照故事導讀重新校對，各語言的物品 lore 修正錯譯，日韓西俄補上任務台詞，炸彈計時列的顏色修正，補上討伐戰賭注與收集資源的句子。\n\n### What's new\n\n- Fixed: the separate translation panel no longer overlaps the original tooltip, and its first row lines up with the original's, including tall item tooltips that Wynntils scales or Wynnventory moves aside.\n- Translations: Simplified Chinese quest dialogue reread against the story guide, item lore corrected in every language, Japanese, Korean, Spanish and Russian quest lines filled in, colours fixed on the bomb timer bars, and the new raid gambit and resource bar lines."
		},
